/* pages/exercise-share/index.wxss — 动作分享详情页
   视觉语言跟训练分享页一致(深色 + 荧光绿主色)。 */

.page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  background: #131313;
  padding: 40rpx 28rpx 200rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.page.theme-day {
  background: #f5f5f5;
}

/* ── 状态区(加载中 / 失效) ── */
.state-box {
  padding: 160rpx 40rpx;
  text-align: center;
}
.state-icon {
  font-size: 72rpx;
  margin-bottom: 24rpx;
}
.state-title {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #f2f2f2;
  margin-bottom: 12rpx;
}
.theme-day .state-title { color: #1a1a1a; }
.state-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 0 12rpx;
  padding: 22rpx 48rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: #ccf200;
  color: #000;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
}

/* ── 分享者 ── */
.share-head {
  margin-bottom: 28rpx;
}
.owner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}
.owner-avatar {
  width: 76rpx;
  height: 76rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  margin-right: 20rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.owner-avatar-placeholder {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 36rpx;
}
.owner-name {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #f2f2f2;
  margin-bottom: 6rpx;
}
.theme-day .owner-name { color: #1a1a1a; }
.owner-label {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #8a8a8a;
}

/* ── 动作卡片 ── */
.ex-card {
  border-radius: 24rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #1a1a1a;
  margin-bottom: 32rpx;
}
.theme-day .ex-card {
  background: #ffffff;
}

/* ── 底部: 收藏 + 去练自己的 ── */
.foot {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16rpx;
}

.fav-btn {
  width: 88rpx;
  height: 88rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.theme-day .fav-btn {
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
}
.fav-btn.active {
  background: rgba(204, 242, 0, 0.18);
}
.fav-btn image {
  width: 40rpx;
  height: 40rpx;
}

.foot-btn {
  flex: 1;
  height: 88rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: #ccf200;
  color: #000;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.foot-btn::after { border: none; }
